Package: LinearityApp
Title: Standard Curve Analysis for Laboratory Assays
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ilya", "Smirnov", , "smirnov.iv.mail@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A 'shiny' application and a set of functions to calculate analyte
    concentrations from optical densities measured in laboratory assays
    (sandwich ELISA, BCA, Griess and others). Fits linear, quadratic,
    four- and five-parameter logistic calibration models with optional
    weighting, compares the models, inverts the fitted curve for samples
    with confidence intervals, flags results outside the calibration range,
    lets the user exclude standard points with a reason and produces
    Excel, CSV and Word outputs. The interface is available in English and
    Russian.
